1)  How to install docker ?

      dnf install docker -y 

2)   how to start and enable services of docker 

  systemctl  start docker 
  systemctl enable docker 

3)   How to pull any docker image from Docker hub  ?

    docker pull  ubuntu

4)   see all pulled docker images 

    docker images 

5)   now create container from above docker image

    docker run  --name c1  -dit   <DOCKER-IMAGE-ID>   

6)  cross check docker container running or not

    docker ps -a 

7)   how to kill / delete docker container  ?

    docker rm -f <CONTAINER-ID/NAME>  
